dit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6900760735623797940/comments/default/7783657392297465587'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6900760735623797940/comments/default/7783657392297465587'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/damned-from-memory-when-drug-war-turns.html?showComment=1355461457211#c7783657392297465587' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/damned-from-memory-when-drug-war-turns.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6900760735623797940' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6900760735623797940' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1963326711"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 13, 2012 at 10:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3310832637813713203</id><published>2012-12-13T16:53:34.835-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-13T16:53:34.835-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It is stories such as this that I present to my fr...</title><content type='html'>It is stories such as this that I present to my friends who still believe the current form of government ruling over us has the potential to be reformed and restored through peaceful political means.  The federal (feral?) government has now strayed so far from its Constitutional bounds that it ceased being legitimate decades ago.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;jk</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6900760735623797940/comments/default/3310832637813713203'/><link rel='self' type='application/ato