chnician--he never met anyone who answered as truthfully as I did. I revealed some personal things when asked, and answered every question with the &amp;quot;highest form of integrity&amp;quot;.&amp;quot; </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6900760735623797940/comments/default/3256207400196981351'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6900760735623797940/comments/default/3256207400196981351'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/damned-from-memory-when-drug-war-turns.html?showComment=1355425465448#c3256207400196981351' title=''/><author><name>Sparky McLaughlin</name><uri>http://www.damnedfrommemory.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/damned-from-memory-when-drug-war-turns.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6900760735623797940' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6900760735623797940' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1385843580"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 13, 2012 at 12:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5095675458215007742</id><published>2012-12-12T18:54:26.850-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-12T18:54:26.850-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;I foreclose on houses for big bank, for jus...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I foreclose on houses for big bank, for just enough money for me to pay tribute to big bank in a mortgage, and city, county, and utility corps. If i didn&amp;#39;t blog about the work, I wouldn&amp;#39;t be able to do it. Anyway, thank you